{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b55df9c18da58b5f","name":"Secret Compartment","source":{"id":"source:reference-b55df9c18da58b5f","title":"Secret Compartment","revision":19756,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:33:20Z","sha256":"633cb587f9ea5d8661daba0ca88a26d24837f8aa0c46f2f3220b7ccee506130a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19756","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Secret%20Compartment&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b55df9c18da58b5f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 600\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Like ",{"tag":"a","children":["Storage Capacity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Storage_Capacity","referenceId":"reference:044432a090694760"},", this Upgrade allows gear to carry smaller gear within it. However, the gear carried in a Secret Compartment is concealed. It takes a DC 30 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check to notice the compartment when it is used, and a DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check to find it with a close, hands-on examination. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," with a Secret Compartment can hold a single item one size smaller than the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," itself. (This is actual size, not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Size"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Size"},"; see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment Sizes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment_Sizes"},".) Thus, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:38dcc06542ba096c"}," (Small weapon, Diminutive object) with a Secret Compartment can hold a Fine-sized object (such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlink","referenceId":"reference:609e72c37493843f"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Frag Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Frag_Grenade","referenceId":"reference:5d38df4b2da8b77e"},").\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
